WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.917
Day one.

00:00:00.917 --> 00:00:02.659
Your shift starts at nine.

00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:05.329
You planned to leave at eight-ten, but last night

00:00:05.329 --> 00:00:08.522
ran later than expected, and you hit snooze twice.

00:00:08.522 --> 00:00:10.379
It's now seven fifty-five.

00:00:10.379 --> 00:00:12.109
You still need to get dressed, grab

00:00:12.109 --> 00:00:14.408
something to eat, and make your bus.

00:00:14.408 --> 00:00:16.335
You have options—but each

00:00:16.335 --> 00:00:18.390
one protects something different.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:20.108
What matters most right now?
